# Unity generated / machine-local folders
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Build output and Android/IL2CPP build cache - regenerated every build and
# far too large for version control (a single Quest build is ~1.3 GB, most of
# it il2cpp intermediate C++). Ignored by decision after real builds appeared.
/[Bb]uilds/
/.utmp/
*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/

# Performance Test Framework run artifacts - regenerated on each test/build run
/[Aa]ssets/[Rr]esources/PerformanceTestRun*.json
/[Aa]ssets/[Rr]esources/PerformanceTestRun*.json.meta

# Unity Version Control (Plastic) local workspace state - machine-specific,
# must never be tracked by Git. The workspace itself is authoritative on the
# Plastic server, not here.
/.plastic/

# Asset Store / Plastic leftovers
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/PlasticSCM*

# Addressables build artifacts
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.consulo/
.gradle/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.tmp
*.pidb
*.pidb.meta
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb
*.mdb.meta
*.opendb
*.VC.db
ExportedObj/

# Unity3D generated crash / info files
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
*.unitypackage
~UnityDirMonSyncFile~*

# "private" convention from the original ignore.conf
*.private
*.private.meta
*.private.[0-9]*
*.private.[0-9]*.meta

# OS cruft
.DS_Store*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
